      "updated": 1795621586436,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "'Failed: delivery timeout'  is NOT  'not written'.\nIt means 'I stopped trying'. An app retry is a NEW send()\nwith a NEW sequence, so the idempotent producer cannot\ncatch it: the sink must dedup.",
      "originalText": "'Failed: delivery timeout'  is NOT  'not written'.\nIt means 'I stopped trying'. An app retry is a NEW send()\nwith a NEW sequence, so the idempotent producer cannot\ncatch it: the sink must dedup.",
