      "text": "Every source except C survives Kafka's idempotent producer.\nD to L all end at the sink, so ONE idempotent sink (PRIMARY KEY event_id + ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING)\nabsorbs them all: it is the non-negotiable last line of defense.",
