      "text": "Relay publishes to Kafka, dies before marking the row.\nRestart → republishes → duplicate in Kafka.\nCure: consumers idempotent by outbox row id.",
      "originalText": "Relay publishes to Kafka, dies before marking the row.\nRestart → republishes → duplicate in Kafka.\nCure: consumers idempotent by outbox row id.",
